#{[17592186486776 #edb/ref 1080 "x+5={t}^{2},\\,y+2=2t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486776 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486776 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5471d6a5-d5f1-5e64-b0d4-d247884f4266" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486821 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5=2{t}^{2},\\,y-2=t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486821 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486821 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "68408a08-0e06-57f9-927a-8ec79117001a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486837 #edb/ref 1080 "x+5=\\frac{1}{8}{t}^{2},\\,y+2=\\frac{1}{4}t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486837 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486837 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6e4a770e-5b76-5688-9d7d-d367b29628f6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486921 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5=\\frac{1}{4}{t}^{2},\\,y-2=\\frac{1}{8}t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486921 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486921 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "956916df-320e-5b5e-b828-825e40cf6ee5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486695 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486776 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486821 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486837 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486921 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186486837 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487259 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d889d998-6d7a-58b2-a490-fd41b8228c67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186487259 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1069 "q-84846" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following sets of parametric equations, defined for $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ generate the horizontal parabola given by the Cartesian equation $(y+2)^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(x+5)?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "da2c9d27-2db1-52e6-a2e3-b28e1798b755" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487386 #edb/ref 1074 "The parametric equations of a horizontal parabola $(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h)$ that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ are\n\n$$\nx-h=p{t}^{2},\\,y-k=2pt,\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nComparing the given Cartesian equation with the general case $(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h),$ we see that the parabola has its vertex at $(h,k)=(-5,-2).$ So we have\n\n$$\nx+5=p{t}^{2},\\,y+2=2pt.\n$$\n\nNow, comparing the right-hand sides of the given Cartesian equation and the general case, then solving for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4p(x-h) & =\\frac{1}{2}(x+5) \\\\ 4p(x+5) & =\\frac{1}{2}(x+5) \\\\ 4p & =\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ p & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the parabola are\n\n$$\nx+5=(\\frac{1}{8}){t}^{2},\\,y+2=2(\\frac{1}{8})t,\n$$\n\nwhich simplify to\n\n$$\nx+5=\\frac{1}{8}{t}^{2},\\,y+2=\\frac{1}{4}t.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
